than later. She is very soft-spoken, but she has a mischievous side that primarily shows in Arima's presence."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is a life-drinking human monster called an Iwaigo (blessed child) whose powers act very much like those of a succubus. As a child, she killed Arima's father and a number of others when she 'awakened' and indiscriminately 'ate' the life energy of all those around her. It was at this time (five years before the beginning of the story) that she raped Arima and he became responsible for 'handling her illness'."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c82483"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7ef0a24a18a8c4a8e045d396da774c45a1429539af8e3193126c91ab79ca02ed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a3e3ec38bbc21f6b6c9bd7b6bd0cb86f319c8f850f2e359de40476f99349cb9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遥 そら","creatorId":"vndb:s195","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s195","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s195","name":"仙台 エリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79890","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c82484","characterName":"阿久戸 麦","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c82484"},"originalCharacterName":"阿久戸 麦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0eb21d8567f9c09d523e4c42d618b526c956086b5ce30289977848546ffc18da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/49622d04175dd1d4df2aa828c1cb25ad283cf8850ae4de34585d79e7be08dc2b.webp","